# The findings the image scan of .github/workflows/docker-image.yml accepts; everything not
# named here still fails it. An entry belongs here only where no rebuild of ours can clear the
# finding, and it carries the reason plus the date it is due back for review: past that date
# Trivy counts the finding again and the gate goes red until someone has looked a second time.
#
# No waiver is currently active.
